worlds = [
    ("W_DARK_FOREST",
     "I am floating forward through a dark forest at night. In front of me, tall twisted trees with bare claw-like branches block out the sky. Thick cold fog hugs the ground in front of me, glowing faintly blue. Small pale blue lights float in the air ahead like lost souls. I drift forward between the trees, weaving left and right. The fog parts around each trunk as I approach. The colors are only deep black, dark grey, and cold blue. I see no other creatures. Only the trees, the fog, and the floating blue lights ahead of me. I continue drifting forward through the dark trees.", 15),

    ("W_ABANDONED",
     "I am drifting slowly forward through a vast abandoned stone cathedral. In front of me, rows of stone columns stretch into the distance on both sides. The ceiling high above is lost in darkness. The stone beside me is cracked and covered with patches of dark moss. A single beam of pale grey light comes from a broken window high above. I can see dust particles floating in that beam. I drift forward down the center aisle. Broken stone fragments and fallen columns lie on the floor below me. The air feels cold. Nothing moves except the drifting dust particles in the light beam. I continue drifting forward through the silent cathedral.", 15),

    ("W_FLOWER_FIELD",
     "I am gliding low over a vast field of wildflowers. In front of me, bright yellow and orange and purple flowers stretch to the horizon. The flower tops brush against the bottom of my view as I pass over them. Warm golden sunlight comes from my left, casting long soft shadows across the flowers. Butterflies drift across my view in front of me, some landing on flowers, others floating past. A few white clouds sit in the soft blue sky above. The warm light catches each flower petal as I glide forward. Everything is soft and warm. I continue my slow glide forward over the endless flowers.", 15),

    ("W_CITY_ROOFTOP",
     "I am standing on a high rooftop terrace overlooking a city at sunset. In front of me, the sky is a gradient of warm orange, pink, and purple. Thousands of tiny city lights begin to appear below as the sky darkens. Strings of warm yellow lights are strung above me on the terrace, gently swaying. Potted olive trees and small plants line the edge of the terrace beside me. I slowly turn my head from left to right, taking in the vast city skyline. The warm sunset light catches the windows of distant buildings. The sky deepens from orange to purple as I watch. The city lights multiply below me as darkness falls. The view is peaceful and expansive.", 15),

    ("W_UNDERWATER_REEF",
     "I am floating through warm shallow tropical water. Above me, sunlight streams down through the surface in visible golden rays. In front of me, colorful coral formations rise from the sandy sea floor below. Orange brain coral, purple fan coral, and green anemones wave gently in the current. A school of tiny bright blue fish darts past in front of me in perfect synchronization. A large sea turtle glides across my view from right to left, not bothered by my presence. Small bubbles drift upward past my face occasionally. I continue my slow drift forward through the reef. Sunlight dances on the sandy patches between coral below me. The water is warm and turquoise. Peaceful underwater atmosphere.", 15),

    ("W_GRAVEYARD",
     "I am drifting slowly through a graveyard at dusk. In front of me, weathered Gothic gravestones and crosses stand at tilted angles, overgrown with dark ivy. The sky above is a painted gradient of deep purple and burnt orange, with visible thick brushstroke textures across the clouds. Tall twisted yew trees line the perimeter on both sides. A thick layer of fog hovers at knee level in front of me, glowing faintly from the last light of dusk. I drift forward between the gravestones. Orange and purple light filters through the fog. A single black crow sits on a stone cross ahead, watching me approach. I drift closer. The crow tilts its head, then takes off, flying upward into the painterly sky. The fog swirls where the crow was. I continue drifting.", 15),

    ("W_SPIRIT_WORLD",
     "I am floating along a winding stone walkway through a vast starry space. There is no ground below me, only stars. Giant glowing paper lanterns on tall wooden poles line the path ahead, casting warm orange light. Strange friendly creatures made of soft white light with large round eyes peek at me from behind the lanterns. I drift forward along the walkway. Above me, a massive glowing moon takes up a quarter of the sky, with soft rings of colored light around it. Small floating islands with single ancient trees drift past on either side of me. Blue and purple fireflies float everywhere around me. The walkway curves ahead into a warm golden glow in the distance. The atmosphere is magical and warm. I continue forward along the floating path toward the golden glow.", 18),

    ("W_GHIBLI_VALLEY",
     "I am floating through a lush green valley painted like a watercolor. In front of me, impossibly green rolling hills stretch in every direction. A single massive ancient tree with a thick trunk and sprawling canopy stands on a hill ahead of me. Its leaves shift from green to gold as a gentle wind passes through them. Small round fuzzy creatures with no visible face, pure white, peek at me from behind rocks and bushes as I pass. A clear stream winds through the valley beside me, the water so clean it is barely visible except for the light reflecting off its surface. The sky above is soft and hazy, with warm clouds painted in broad gentle strokes. I drift forward, passing the ancient tree on my left. The leaves shimmer above me. One of the white creatures watches me from behind a rock, then toddles away. The valley continues endlessly ahead.", 18),

    ("W_CUBIST",
     "I am floating through a landscape made of angled geometric planes like a cubist painting. In front of me, mountains in the distance are faceted like shattered glass, each facet a different shade of warm brown and ochre. The path ahead of me is a series of floating rectangular platforms at different heights. The sky above is divided into angular sections of blue and cream. I drift forward, stepping from one floating platform to the next. With each step the world rearranges itself around me — the mountain facets slide and re-form, the sky sections tilt and shift. A tree made of green and gold triangles stands ahead of me, its branches angular and sharp. I drift past it. The tree facets rotate slowly, catching light from shifting angles. The entire world feels like a painting that is still being painted as I move through it.", 15),

    ("W_INK_WATER",
     "I am floating through a world made of colored ink dispersing through clear water. In front of me, swirls of deep blue ink curl and branch like a living nervous system. Patches of warm crimson and gold ink hang suspended around me, slowly blooming and twisting as I pass. The ink forms temporary shapes — a flower, a face, a bird — that dissolve back into swirls as I drift by. The background is pale white like paper, visible through the thinning ink. Bubbles of clear space open and close around me as the currents shift. I continue floating forward through the shifting colored clouds. No solid forms anywhere. Only liquid color in constant slow motion all around me.", 15),

    ("W_NEON_RAIN",
     "I am walking through a futuristic city street at night in heavy rain. In front of me, towering buildings rise on both sides covered in glowing neon signs in electric blue, hot pink, and vibrant green. Rain falls steadily in front of me, each drop catching the neon light. The wet pavement below me reflects the glowing signs in blurred streaks of color. Steam rises from a vent beside me, glowing pink from below. A lone figure with a bright red umbrella walks past in the distance ahead of me, the only person I see. I continue walking forward through the rain and neon. The reflections on the wet ground shift with each step I take. The air is thick with haze and glowing particles. Electric blue and hot pink dominate my view.", 18),

    ("W_AUTUMN_FOREST",
     "I am walking along a winding dirt path through a forest in autumn. In front of me, the trees are dense with leaves in deep red, burnt orange, and gold. The ground beside the path is thick with fallen leaves. Sunlight breaks through the canopy above me in scattered golden beams. Leaves fall continuously around me. Some land on the path ahead, others float past close enough to blur. A gust of wind sweeps through from behind me, lifting hundreds of leaves into the air in a swirling dance around me. The leaves spiral and tumble past my face. For a moment I see nothing but swirling red and gold. The leaves settle slowly as the wind passes. The path continues ahead through the golden forest. Warm light shifts as clouds pass above.", 15),

    ("W_DESERT_TEMPLE",
     "I am approaching an ancient sandstone temple half-buried in a vast desert. In front of me, the sun is low, casting long deep shadows across the sand. The temple carved pillars and walls emerge from the sand at impossible angles. I drift toward the main entrance, a dark archway ahead of me. The sandstone beside me is weathered and layered with horizontal striations. Sand swirls across the ground in serpentine patterns around me. I enter the archway, passing from warm bright orange sunlight into cool deep shadow. Inside, shafts of golden light cut through cracks in the ceiling ahead, illuminating floating dust. Carvings cover the walls beside me. I drift deeper into the cool dark interior, the only light the occasional shaft of gold from above.", 18),

    ("W_INFINITE_LIBRARY",
     "I am floating through an infinite library. In front of me, vast arched ceilings stretch impossibly high above, fading into darkness. Towering bookshelves extend in every direction as far as I can see, filled with ancient leather-bound books in warm reds and browns and golds. Floating lanterns drift slowly through the space around me, casting warm shifting light across the book spines. A massive central staircase spirals upward and downward ahead of me, seeming to go forever in both directions. I drift forward between the shelves. A reading table with an open book and a single candle sits in a clearing ahead of me. The candle flame is steady. The open book pages are blank cream. I drift past the table. The shelves continue endlessly in all directions around me. The lanterns continue their slow drift through the infinite space.", 18),

    ("W_STARRY_VOID",
     "I am floating through an endless void filled with stars. There is no ground below me, no up or down. Only infinite dark space around me filled with countless points of light in front of me. The stars around me vary in size and color — some warm white, some faint blue, some distant and red. Slow drifts of multicolored cosmic dust hang in the distance around me, their colors shifting between deep violet, soft pink, and warm gold. I rotate slowly, taking in the full expanse of stars around me. A cluster of brighter stars ahead seems to pulse in rhythm. I drift toward them. As I approach, the stars part to reveal a warm golden light beyond. The light grows slowly as I drift toward it. The stars continue to wheel around me as the light ahead expands.", 20),

    ("W_CLOUD_CITY",
     "I am floating through a city built among clouds. In front of me, white and gold towers rise from thick white cloud banks below. Their architecture mixes classical columns with impossibly light structures that seem to float. Delicate bridges of light connect the towers around me. The sky above is a soft gradient of pale blue and warm gold. I drift along one of the light bridges toward a central tower ahead of me. Winged figures made of light glide between distant towers. The surface of the bridge below me is translucent, revealing clouds rolling far beneath. A gentle warm wind moves through the space around me. The bridge shimmers as I cross it. I reach the central tower and pass through an open archway into a warm golden interior. Light streams through high windows ahead of me, illuminating floating dust motes that glitter like tiny gold coins.", 20),

    ("W_LAVA_CAVE",
     "I am floating through a volcanic cave system deep underground. In front of me, the walls are rough black volcanic rock with veins of glowing orange where molten lava flows behind cracks. The heat shimmers in the air ahead of me. I pass through a narrow passage that opens into a vast cavern ahead. A river of glowing molten lava flows through the center of the cavern below me, casting flickering orange and red light across the walls. Stalactites hang from the ceiling above, their tips glowing red from the heat below. Sparks and embers rise from the lava river in front of me, floating upward past my face and fading. I drift along the edge of the lava river. The heat shimmer distorts my view of the far wall. The only colors around me are black, deep red, and glowing orange.", 18),

    ("W_CRYSTAL_NEXUS",
     "I am floating through a vast chamber lined with massive crystals. In front of me, crystals of many colors jut from the walls at all angles — amethyst purple, rose quartz pink, citrine gold, and clear white. A warm golden light at the center of the chamber ahead of me glows steadily, casting prismatic reflections across every crystal surface around me. I drift toward the central light. As I approach, the light separates into its component colors, casting rainbow patterns across the crystal walls around me. Small floating crystal fragments drift in the air around me, each one catching and refracting the light. I pass through the rainbow light. The colors shift slowly across the crystal surfaces as I move. The chamber around me is vast and silent. I continue drifting past the central light.", 18),

    ("W_GROTTO",
     "I am floating through a hidden grotto where a waterfall cascades into a crystal-clear pool ahead of me. The grotto walls beside me are covered in glowing moss that emits a soft blue-green light. Thin vines hang from the ceiling above me. The waterfall ahead is illuminated from behind by sunlight, making the falling water glow with warm light. I drift toward the pool. The water surface below me is perfectly clear, showing smooth pebbles and small fish beneath. Ripples spread outward from where the waterfall hits the surface. I reach the pool edge. The blue-green bioluminescent moss and warm golden sunlight create a magical atmosphere around me. I hover at the edge of the pool, the waterfall continuing its steady cascade in front of me.", 18),

    ("W_FLOATING_ISLANDS",
     "I am drifting among floating islands in a hazy golden sky. In front of me, each island is a chunk of earth with lush green grass and weeping willow trees hanging over its edges. Roots dangle beneath each island below me, swaying in the wind. Waterfalls cascade from some islands ahead, falling into mist below where no ground is visible. I drift between the islands, weaving around the dangling roots and smaller floating rocks around me. Warm golden light fills everything around me from no visible source above. A flock of birds circles one of the larger islands ahead. I drift past them as they continue circling. The islands stretch ahead into the golden haze as far as I can see. The atmosphere around me is warm, quiet, and peaceful.", 18),
